  "title": "Batched Matrix Multiplication（批量矩阵乘法）",
  "titleEn": "Batched Matrix Multiplication",
  "titleZh": "批量矩阵乘法",
  "description": "使用 CUDA 对 FP32 行主序矩阵批次执行独立矩阵乘法",
  "problemId": "batched-matrix-multiplication",
